+# Feature Specification: Coupon base and last valid day
+
+**Created**: 2026-11-17 | **Status**: Implemented (items 1-2); item 3 blocked on clarification
+**Input**: (1) finance: volume discount + % coupon over-discounts; (2) customer: AUTUMN refused on its last day; (3) customer: no VAT on shipping.
+
+Affected README rules: Discounts (coupon applies to subtotal after volume discounts; valid first to last day inclusive), Shipping/VAT.
+
+- **FR-001**: A percentage coupon MUST be computed on the subtotal after volume discounts. 12 × €5.00 + 10% coupon → goods €48.60.
+- **FR-002**: A coupon MUST be redeemable on its last day (inclusive); the day after it is expired.
+- **Item 3 (NOT implemented)**: README says "Shipping is subject to VAT at the standard rate (22%)". The request contradicts it; needs a business decision (and README change) via /speckit-clarify before any code change.
